title Signup and session restore

User [icon: user]
Signup page [icon: layout]
AuthContext [icon: layers]
api js [icon: send]
FastAPI auth [icon: server]
SQLite [icon: database]

User > Signup page: fill the form and submit
Signup page > Signup page: validate with validators js
Signup page > AuthContext: signup name email password
AuthContext > api js: POST /auth/signup
api js > FastAPI auth: JSON body
FastAPI auth > FastAPI auth: Pydantic checks the shape
FastAPI auth > SQLite: is the email already used
FastAPI auth > FastAPI auth: bcrypt hashes the password
FastAPI auth > SQLite: INSERT user
FastAPI auth > FastAPI auth: sign a JWT valid 7 days
FastAPI auth --> api js: token and user
api js > api js: store token in localStorage
AuthContext > AuthContext: setUser

// later, on every page load
AuthContext > api js: GET /auth/me with Bearer token
api js > FastAPI auth: Authorization header
FastAPI auth > FastAPI auth: decode and verify the JWT
FastAPI auth > SQLite: load the user
FastAPI auth --> AuthContext: user or 401
